+  every object in it is reachable from its refs; one holding an unreachable
+  object stays unmarked and refused, like the pre-isolation layout. The
+  quarantine sweep removes only quarantines old enough to be a killed
+  push's leftovers, and after a failed publication only those that push
+  created, so a concurrent push is not broken.
